Isaiah	Is	27	25	3	Therefore shall a strong people praise thee, the city of mighty nations shall fear thee.
Isaiah	Is	27	25	4	Because thou hast been a strength to the poor, a strength to the needy in his distress: a refuge from the whirlwind, a shadow from the heat. For the blast of the mighty is like a whirlwind beating against a wall.
