Isaiah	Is	27	29	1	Woe to Ariel, to Ariel the city which David took: year is added to year: the solemnities are at an end.
Isaiah	Is	27	29	2	And I will make a trench about Ariel, and it shall be in sorrow and mourning, and it shall be to me as Ariel.
