Isaiah	Is	27	29	8	And as he that is hungry dreameth, and eateth, but when he is awake, his soul is empty: and as he that is thirsty dreameth, and drinketh, and after he is awake, is yet faint with thirst, and his soul is empty: so shall be the multitude of all the Gentiles, that have fought against mount Sion.
Isaiah	Is	27	29	9	Be astonished, and wander, waver, and stagger: be drunk, and not with wine: stagger, and not with drunkenness.
