Isaiah	Is	27	51	21	Therefore hear this, thou poor little one, and thou that art drunk but no with wine.
Isaiah	Is	27	51	22	Thus saith thy Sovereign the Lord and thy God, who will fight for his people: Behold I have taken out of thy hand the cup of dead sleep, the dregs of the cup of my indignation, thou shalt not drink it again any more.
