Isaiah	Is	27	52	5	And now what have I here, saith the Lord: for my people is taken away gratis. They that rule over them treat them unjustly, saith the Lord, and my name is continually blasphemed all the day long.
Isaiah	Is	27	52	6	Therefore my people shall know my name in that day: for I myself that spoke, behold I am here.
