Isaiah	Is	27	53	1	Who hath believed our report? and to whom is the arm of the Lord revealed?
Isaiah	Is	27	53	2	And he shall grow up as a tender plant before him, and as a root out of a thirsty ground: there is no beauty in him, nor comeliness: and we have seen him, and there was no sightliness, that we should be desirous of him:
