Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	4	Hear ye the word of the Lord, O house of Jacob, and all ye families of the house of Israel.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	5	Thus saith the Lord: What iniquity have your fathers found in me, that they are gone far from me, and have walked after vanity, and are become vain?
Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	6	And they have not said: Where is the Lord, that made us come up out of the land of Egypt? that led us through the desert, through a land uninhabited and unpassable, through a land of drought, and the image of death, through a land wherein no man walked, nor any man dwelt?
Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	7	And I brought you into the land of Carmel, to eat the fruit thereof, and the best things thereof: and when ye entered in, you defiled my land, and made my inheritance an abomination.
