Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	12	Be astonished, O ye heavens, at this, and ye gates thereof, be very desolate, saith the Lord.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	13	For my people have done two evils. They have forsaken me, the fountain of living water, and have digged to themselves cisterns, broken cisterns, that can hold no water.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	2	14	Is Israel a bondman, or a homeborn slave? why then is he become prey?
