Jeremiah	Jer	28	4	5	Declare ye in Juda, and make it heard in Jerusalem: speak, and sound with the trumpet in the land: cry aloud, and say: Assemble yourselves, and let us go into strong cities.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	4	6	Set up the standard in Sion. Strengthen yourselves, stay not: for I bring evil from the north, and great destruction.
