Jeremiah	Jer	28	5	9	Shall I not visit for these things, sayeth the Lord? and shall not my soul take revenge on such a nation?
Jeremiah	Jer	28	5	10	Scale down the walls thereof, and throw them down, but do not utterly destroy: take away the branches thereof, because they are not the Lord's.
