Jeremiah	Jer	28	6	4	Prepare ye war against her: arise, and let us go up at midday: woe unto us, for the day is declined, for the shadows of the evening are grown longer.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	6	5	Arise, and let us go up in the night, and destroy her houses.
